\p \v 22 \w If|strong="G1487"\w* \w anyone|strong="G5100"\w* \w {does} not|strong="G3756"\w* \w love|strong="G5368"\w* \w the|strong="G3588"\w* \w Lord|strong="G2962"\w*, \w let him be|strong="G1510"\w* \w under a curse|strong="G331"\w*. \w Come|strong="G3134"\w*, \w O Lord|strong="G3134"\w*!\f + \fr 16:22 \ft Greek \fqa Marana Tha! \ft from a transliteration of the Aramaic, an exclamation of approaching divine judgment\f*
